Subject: [PATCH] xpon: serialize Q1000K T-CONT commands and contain failures

Use the bounded native MAC table helper, preserve bindings on failed setup,
close queues through the native Ethernet consumer, and propagate control
errors. Never reuse uncertain channels or substitute a global FCS reset for
verified per-channel retirement. The service readiness gates remain intact.

---
